    {
      "minutes": 10,
      "instruction": "Heat the oven to 190°C fan. Halve the peppers and rub them with a little of the oil and salt. Chop the onion."
    },
    {
      "minutes": 8,
      "instruction": "Soften the onion in the rest of the oil, add the mince and cook until it is no longer pink. Stir in the garlic, paprika and cumin.",
